      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后。北港火山被选为URA最优秀沙土赛马娘。\n她在纪念活动上完成了\n和醒目飞鹰同台的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc9d82d51f36ba35fc8c9b5e9c10d6a7afa10c56f453facdcb5b31fc05d4fce5",
